event: thinking
data: {"id": "28edc9f7ca954a97-thinking-layer-1812", "run_id": "28edc9f7ca954a97", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我的集群中检测到一个异常 Pod，具体如下：\n\n### 异常实体定位\n\n*   **异常 Pod**: `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` (Namespace: `aiops-case-05`)\n*   **当前状态**: `ContainerCreating`\n*   **Ready 状态**: `0/1`\n*   **IP 分配**: `<none>` (未分配 IP，表明容器运行时沙箱尚未成功创建或网络插件尚未就绪)\n\n### 异常组拆分\n\n*   **Group 1**:\n    *   **类型**: `SandboxCreateFailed`\n    *   **描述**: Pod 卡在 `ContainerCreating` 阶段，未分配 IP。这通常意味着 kubelet 在创建 Pod 沙箱（Sandbox）时遇到了问题，可能涉及 CNI 网络插件配置、RuntimeClass 设置、或基础 Pause 镜像拉取失败。\n    *   **成员**: `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx`\n\n### 诊断建议与 Runbook\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1788781239530}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "28edc9f7ca954a97-node_complete-layer", "run_id": "28edc9f7ca954a97", "seq": 1813, "ts_ms": 1788781248607, "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "duration_seconds": 53.84, "state_snapshot": {"layer": "Layer.ABNORMAL", "layers": ["ABNORMAL"], "layer_confidence": 0.8, "layer_reasoning": "工具返回显示集群中仅有1个异常Pod。Pod 'workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx' (Namespace: aiops-case-05) 状态为 'ContainerCreating'，且 IP 为 '<none>'。未分配 IP 是沙箱创建失败的典型特征（SandboxCreateFailed），表明容器运行时或 CNI 插件尚未完成网络沙箱的初始化。虽然 VolumeMountFailed 也可能导致该状态，但通常伴随特定挂载错误事件，而 IP 未分配更指向底层沙箱/网络层。根据诊断逻辑，当前最可能的异常类型为 SandboxCreateFailed。", "layer_analysis": "{\"layer\": \"DIAGNOSTIC\", \"derived_layer\": \"\", \"layers\": [], \"layer_name\": \"\", \"confidence\": 0.8, \"reasoning\": \"工具返回显示集群中仅有1个异常Pod。Pod 'workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx' (Namespace: aiops-case-05) 状态为 'ContainerCreating'，且 IP 为 '<none>'。未分配 IP 是沙箱创建失败的典型特征（SandboxCreateFailed），表明容器运行时或 CNI 插件尚未完成网络沙箱的初始化。虽然 VolumeMountFailed 也可能导致该状态，但通常伴随特定挂载错误事件，而 IP 未分配更指向底层沙箱/网络层。根据诊断逻辑，当前最可能的异常类型为 SandboxCreateFailed。\", \"abnormal_pods\": [{\"name\": \"workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-05\", \"status\": \"ContainerCreating\"}], \"pod_status_keyword\": \"ContainerCreating\", \"pod_abnormal_type\": \"SandboxCreateFailed\", \"status_category\": \"Abnormal\", \"key_entities\": [{\"type\": \"Pod\", \"name\": \"workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-05\"}], \"possible_scenarios\": [{\"scenario\": \"Sandbox creation failure due to CNI/IPAM issues\", \"probability\": \"High\", \"reason\": \"Pod is stuck in ContainerCreating state without IP assignment.\"}, {\"scenario\": \"RuntimeClass handler mismatch or missing\", \"probability\": \"Medium\", \"reason\": \"Specified RuntimeClass might not match node runtime configuration.\"}, {\"scenario\": \"Pause image pull failure\", \"probability\": \"Medium\", \"reason\": \"Failure to pull the base pause image can block sandbox creation.\"}], \"abnormal_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"g1\", \"statu