data: {"id": "28edc9f7ca954a97-thinking-parallel_evidence-2310", "run_id": "28edc9f7ca954a97", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 诊断结论\n\n**根因判定**：**Multus NetworkAttachmentDefinition `unavailable-network` 不存在**。\n\n**事实证据**：\n1.  **Pod 状态**：`Pending`，单容器 `app` 处于 `ContainerCreating` 等待状态，重启次数为 0。\n2.  **Kubernetes Events**：\n    *   `Warning NoNetworkFound`: Multus CNI 插件报错，提示在网络附加定义命名空间 `aiops-case-05` 中找不到网络定义 `unavailable-network`。\n    *   `Warning FailedCreatePodSandBox`: kubelet 因 Multus 无法配置网络，导致 Pod Sandbox 创建失败，进而导致容器一直处于创建等待中。\n3.  **Pod YAML 配置**：容器指定了镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，但未发现 vol", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788781281474, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

